Because I know exactly
what I saw and what I felt.

317
00:18:46.190 --> 00:18:48.400
We were swallowed by the whale.

318
00:18:50.150 --> 00:18:51.820
[USOPP]
Is this a dream?

319
00:18:51.820 --> 00:18:54.400
[ZORO]
Yeah, I'd say that's a
fair guess.

320
00:19:00.080 --> 00:19:01.610
Then what's with this island?

321
00:19:01.610 --> 00:19:02.620
And the house?

322
00:19:02.620 --> 00:19:04.000
Illusions.

323
00:19:08.590 --> 00:19:10.750
